--[[ GIANT SAND WORM (FE)  -  uses EVERY brick it can find (minimum 60)
  A huge segmented worm that swims half-buried in the sand, erupts, roars, lunges and slams.
  Animation rules used: follow-the-leader body (overlap), traveling slither wave, ease in/out speed,
  anticipation before every attack, follow-through springs, impact + ripple, weight (sag), breathing mouth.

  Buttons : Summon | Hunt player (type a name) | Calm | Control (WASD) | Size box (type 10x, 50x, ...)
  Abilities: Roar | Lunge (bites the typed player, or straight ahead) | Slam | Dive (hide under the sand)
  Keys    : R roar, F lunge, G slam, V dive  (PC)   -   the buttons do the same on mobile

  FE : unanchored + un-welded bricks you own, anti-gravity, your avatar rides inside the body.
  Colors are LOCAL ONLY; the bricks themselves move for everyone.
  CUTSCENE on Summon (swim-in -> coil -> eruption -> roar -> pull-back), with a Skip button.
  GUARD: when another player stands near the worm, your hidden avatar parks on the bricks next to that player
  so you stay the closest player and the worm does not fall apart.
]]

